{"id":"gouverneur","lemma":"gouverneur","pos":"noun","rank":1493,"glosses":["governor"],"ipa":"/ɡu.vɛʁ.nœʁ/","audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/e/e1/LL-Q150_%28fra%29-J%C3%A9r%C3%A9my-G%C3%BCnther-Heinz_J%C3%A4hnick-gouverneur.wav/LL-Q150_%28fra%29-J%C3%A9r%C3%A9my-G%C3%BCnther-Heinz_J%C3%A4hnick-gouverneur.wav.mp3","gender":"m","forms":{"plural":"gouverneurs","feminine":"gouverneure"},"examples":[{"text":"Le gouverneur ordonna une enquête.","en":"The governor ordered an investigation.","words":[{"g":"the / it"},null,{"g":"to arrange","l":"ordonner"},{"g":"a"},{"g":"inquest"}]},{"text":"Le gouverneur a pris l'argent dans une caisse noire.","en":"The governor took the money out of a slush fund.","words":[{"g":"the / it"},null,{"g":"has","l":"avoir"},{"g":"to take","l":"prendre"},{"g":"the / it"},{"g":"money"},{"g":"in"},{"g":"a"},null,null],"phrases":[[8,10,"slush fund"]]},{"text":"Tom a été gracié par le gouverneur.","en":"Tom was pardoned by the governor.","words":[null,{"g":"has","l":"avoir"},{"g":"summer"},{"g":"to pardon","l":"gracier"},{"g":"through"},{"g":"the / it"},null]},{"text":"Le gouverneur fut surpris de la réponse de la commission.","en":"The governor was surprised by the commission's response.","words":[{"g":"the / it"},null,{"g":"bole","l":"fût"},{"g":"surprised"},null,null,{"g":"retort, comeback"},null,null,{"g":"commission"}],"phrases":[[4,6,"of the"],[7,9,"of the"]]},{"text":"Je veux mettre à profit l'occasion de parler au gouverneur.","en":"I want to take advantage of the opportunity to speak to the governor.","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"to want, wish, desire","l":"vouloir"},null,null,null,{"g":"the / it"},{"g":"occasion, opportunity"},{"g":"of / from"},{"g":"to speak, talk"},{"g":"to the"},null],"phrases":[[2,5,"to put to use"]]}]}